{"data": [{"author_id": "1654232753813196800", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:25:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115208360425623557"], "id": "2115208360425623557", "in_reply_to_user_id": "16608630", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115144737858502675", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ashnichrist @grok @bot Workflow", "url": "https://x.com/Strive_Liberty/status/2115208360425623557"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot: From Beginner to Pro in Six Practical Steps"}, "author_id": "1828750560776118272", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:17:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115206378499506332"], "id": "2115206378499506332", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 460, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/fZNbxfzacA", "url": "https://x.com/Michael_Fenech_/status/2115206378499506332"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115206230889414656"]}, "author_id": "409404389", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:17:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115206297713025135"], "id": "2115206297713025135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Are you a web designer that uses #Divi, and want to try and let your Grok @bot help you with websites? You'll notice it can't access many setting &amp; elements in Divi 4 &amp; 5. Now it can! We built the Divi Bot Bridge! Now your Grok Bot can access ALL of Divi. https://t.co/BSLqb8uKEw", "url": "https://x.com/TraviXai/status/2115206297713025135"}, {"article": {"title": "How I Taught a Grok Bot to Charge My Teslas From Solar"}, "author_id": "1507564765010280449", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:14:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115205490460528919"], "id": "2115205490460528919", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/RIV4N94FBY", "url": "https://x.com/affinity892/status/2115205490460528919"}, {"author_id": "76098307", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:14:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115205484936655356"], "id": "2115205484936655356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The use of @Grok @bot has cut my routine research work for content in half and gave me a path to more reliable #AIgenerated content under #ResponsibleAI thanks to @AnthropicAI and @OpenAI API connections. HAIA-CAIPR has a functioning home for automation and Multi-AI that follows", "url": "https://x.com/basilpuglisi/status/2115205484936655356"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115205331429052416"]}, "author_id": "1737038571092029440", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:13:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115205393479557145"], "id": "2115205393479557145", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 135, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114632753954099609", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MY AI AGENT BUILT ON GROK BOT READS 4 MILLION X POSTS A DAY AND SEES A MEMECOIN NARRATIVE BEFORE THE COIN EXISTS\n\nIT BOUGHT A FISH AT $4.5K MCAP AND SOLD 8 SECONDS BEFORE THE TOP FOR +150 SOL\n\nabout $28,259 in profit\n\neveryone trades the chart\n\nthe chart is the last thing to move https://t.co/S9kD0js0VX https://t.co/StNLWtsoji", "url": "https://x.com/Hrundel75/status/2115205393479557145"}, {"article": {"title": "Agent or automation? We've been asking the wrong question for two years"}, "author_id": "3035511682", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:12:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115205104198705515"], "id": "2115205104198705515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/9lQIkP08OO", "url": "https://x.com/intelligence318/status/2115205104198705515"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115204774979424256", "3_2115204774987710464", "3_2115204775126212609", "3_2115204773620367360"]}, "author_id": "2044264055536316416", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:11:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204848069292498"], "id": "2115204848069292498", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@elonmusk @xai @grok @bot @poteto @mattyp I've been running a 14-bot team in Grok Bot and built XBrain, a local memory layer on the shared VM. Lookups return only the top-ranked facts (SQLite FTS5 + int8 vectors), capped at 300 tokens, instead of whole chunks. Early tests took https://t.co/di7QIo4Ri7", "url": "https://x.com/MarketForgeIQ/status/2115204848069292498"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115204738845233153"]}, "author_id": "3297437768", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:11:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204789243928854"], "id": "2115204789243928854", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112214741103825314", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "this is wild. jev + grok bot makes the same workflow 90% faster. nearly half the time from idea to finished work, without you coordinating every step\n\nyou drop an idea. grok bot breaks it into tasks. jev compares the next actions and picks the path. grok bot executes, checks the https://t.co/LoaDJnb9CN https://t.co/sUTgoed72a", "url": "https://x.com/0xnineinch/status/2115204789243928854"}, {"author_id": "1819833399206727680", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:11:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204680489799883"], "id": "2115204680489799883", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "so today my grok bot set up a cloudflare account for me \ud83e\udd2a\n\ni didnt click through anything myself. i just said what i wanted and it did the boring parts (signup, settings, all that stuff i always postpone)\n\nand honestly? ive been avoiding this for weeks bc it felt like one of", "url": "https://x.com/Necro______/status/2115204680489799883"}, {"author_id": "802179971909349376", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:10:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204606703640923"], "id": "2115204606703640923", "in_reply_to_user_id": "845689249", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115199998904385714", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@heckyessica Sounds strange, and I know everyone is talking about it, set up a grok bot. You can tell it what the goal is, whether it should make suggestions, treat it as a daily food diary, and call it Mike (or whatever name you want).\n\nMine already pointed out that my post lunchtime carb", "url": "https://x.com/JamesDeroest/status/2115204606703640923"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115092164883464192"]}, "author_id": "2077176702938075136", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:10:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204519512445006"], "id": "2115204519512445006", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111895215556456480", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy f*ck, SpaceXAI just released 56 Grok Bot jobs that companies pay freelancers for every month\n\nall free, one click to install. most people will see a list. it's 56 services you could sell\n\n5 you could start this week:\n\n\u2192 Newsletter Writer: a monthly issue for brands that https://t.co/xFLKscIUIb https://t.co/OhFKJYTpqo", "url": "https://x.com/sendme_ai/status/2115204519512445006"}, {"author_id": "14899529", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:09:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204356916289571"], "id": "2115204356916289571", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2066250685512110080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115167081780093145", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@firesidealpha @bot I want to use the replies to this X post to find practical ways to improve my Grok bots and workflows, especially ways to remove manual effort.\n\nRead the post and all of its replies. If you can only see some of the replies, say so up front and work from what you can see.", "url": "https://x.com/rickylim/status/2115204356916289571"}, {"author_id": "2113370954617262080", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:08:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204121879888209"], "id": "2115204121879888209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Okay I got on board the Grok Bot train and I\u2019m immediately addicted. What do people set up first??", "url": "https://x.com/ffsfounder/status/2115204121879888209"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115203942732730368"]}, "author_id": "2112479295410999297", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:08:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115204086496629080"], "id": "2115204086496629080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114671097459183871", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HOLY SH*T. grok bot made me $11,382 betting on the weather. i'm 19 and i still can't explain this to my mom\n\nfor months i kept asking myself one thing: which market do the big trading bots ignore\n\nso i sat down with grok bot and we went through every polymarket category\n\ncrypto https://t.co/jHxzlzcIoJ https://t.co/O29Du9VtJP", "url": "https://x.com/0xTeddet/status/2115204086496629080"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115203803947618304"]}, "author_id": "388011911", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:07:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115203853855678748"], "id": "2115203853855678748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm not a coder. But I've got a content team now.\n\n4 AI bots built in Grok Bot:\nResearcher finds what trade owners are talking about.\nChief of Staff writes drafts in my voice.\nFact Checker kills anything private or made up.\nTracker logs what goes out.\n\nNothing posts without me. https://t.co/tdOnlDFb0q", "url": "https://x.com/Kev_Gonzo/status/2115203853855678748"}, {"article": {"title": "ELON CHRON: 27th of October, 2026"}, "author_id": "1234183597583740929", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:07:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115203743184498713"], "id": "2115203743184498713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 973, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "https://t.co/f61esVS9IC", "url": "https://x.com/SERobinsonJr/status/2115203743184498713"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2115203399599726592"]}, "author_id": "1749984407304200192", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:06:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115203407896104987"], "id": "2115203407896104987", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1749984407304200192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115203397733240849", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Updating a routine in Grok bot during a phone call with my agent https://t.co/c6ZLMvKz9Y", "url": "https://x.com/liminalprompt/status/2115203407896104987"}, {"author_id": "1171603417749315584", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:04:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115202923005452535"], "id": "2115202923005452535", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Big news: we \"hired\" @poteto from the Grok Bot team.\n\nShe doesn't know. She doesn't work with us. But she and the rest of the Grok Bot team ship so fast that we built the next best thing.\n\nEvery morning, we upgrade our bots. Here's how:\n\n1. A bot reads the Grok Bot changelog and", "url": "https://x.com/talentacommerce/status/2115202923005452535"}, {"author_id": "100283872", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:03:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115202636601348250"], "id": "2115202636601348250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 292, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115202498617057725", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Yesterday we saw you can now instantly setup a solana wallet and have your @grok bot trade memecoins.\n\nSo we built a platform you can launch your own grok bot trading agent that is actually good in seconds.\n\nFomo but for agents.\n\nIntroducing \"Trenchers\"\n\nhttps://t.co/lUDGRj3AdV https://t.co/xpjNT8FpjV", "url": "https://x.com/Weaveronsol/status/2115202636601348250"}, {"author_id": "2096398346512429057", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:00:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115202108693873055"], "id": "2115202108693873055", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114854697777381740", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is a sharp setup. DuckyDoesIt runs five AI agents as a stock research team, with his Grok Bot \"Chief\" in charge: one reads charts, one checks fundamentals, one reads the 10-Ks, one tracks sentiment, and one argues the bear case. Love the built-in devil's advocate. Congrats, https://t.co/tDox2XSZ5i", "url": "https://x.com/botpagesco/status/2115202108693873055"}, {"author_id": "1585689395801493504", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115201958655201709"], "id": "2115201958655201709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot\u6bcf\u500bBot\u90fd\u914d\u4e00\u53f0\u96f2\u7aef\u96fb\u8166\n\n\u6709\u700f\u89bd\u5668\u3001\u6a94\u6848\u7cfb\u7d71\u548c\u7d42\u7aef\u6a5f\uff0c\u7b46\u96fb\u95d4\u4e0a\u4e5f\u6703\u7e7c\u7e8c\u505a\u4e8b\n2\u52306\u500bBot\u53ef\u4ee5\u958b\u7fa4\u7d44\u5206\u5de5\u3001\u4e92\u76f8\u4ea4\u63a5\n\u4e00\u500bBot\u6700\u591a\u80fd\u8a2d50\u500b\u6392\u7a0broutine\n\u51fa\u8655\uff1ahttps://t.co/KjgUBkFgGD\u5b98\u65b9\u6587\u4ef6\n\n\u4f60\u6703\u60f3\u5148\u8b93Bot\u5e6b\u4f60\u8dd1\u54ea\u4ef6\u6bcf\u5929\u91cd\u8907\u7684\u4e8b\uff1f", "url": "https://x.com/2015ayien/status/2115201958655201709"}, {"article": {"title": "Before You Add Another Grok Bot, Run These 7 Tests"}, "author_id": "1674918543891021826", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:00:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115201943568359713"], "id": "2115201943568359713", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 52, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your Grok Bot can finish the task twice\u2014and call both runs a success.\n\nI put together 7 tests for duplicate work, interrupted runs, stale evidence, and weak reviews. Includes a job card and a one-bot vs. team scorecard.\n\nFull breakdown below \u2193 https://t.co/M15ROXKSMO", "url": "https://x.com/sorryimgeek/status/2115201943568359713"}, {"author_id": "14899529", "created_at": "2026-10-27T22:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115201882176332024"], "id": "2115201882176332024", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1